---
title: "One input path for a Claude TUI channel, issue 7272 (landed code + 4f design)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Driving
    lg1: Unsure
    lg2: Waiting
    lg3: Restart
    lg4: Breaks DraftSafe
    lg5: Breaks BusyInputLands or HeldNotDropped or NoDeadlock or NoSilentLoss in some cases
    lg6: Path to the BusyInputLands or DraftSafe or HeldNotDropped or NoDeadlock or NoSilentLoss bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 pink
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 mayBreak
  class lg6 bugPath
  s0: No input waiting (Claude busy)
  s1: No input waiting (Claude idle)
  s2: Inputs wait, no drive running (Claude busy)
  s3: Inputs wait, no drive running (Claude idle)
  s4: Input taken, composer being read (Claude busy)
  s5: Input taken, composer being read (Claude idle)
  s6: Ready to paste without C-s
  s7: Keys started, pasting
  s8: Pasted, Enter next
  s9: Server restarting, line kept on disk
  s10: Write uncertain, waits for the deadline, draft sent with an input
  s11: Maybe sent, nobody watching it
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: a Discord input is admitted
  s1 --> s3: a Discord input is admitted
  s2 --> s4: the drive takes the first input
  s3 --> s3: a Discord input is admitted
  s3 --> s5: the drive takes the first input
  s4 --> s6: the composer reads empty or cannot be read
  s5 --> s5: you type a draft or a modal opens
  s6 --> s7: the attempt is armed (C-s if parking)
  s5 --> s6: the drive pastes behind text in the composer [unread, or no C-s allowed] or the composer reads empty or cannot be read
  s5 --> s1: the drive is held [modal, or unread when that holds]
  s7 --> s8: the input is pasted
  s8 --> s0: Enter is applied, settled as sent
  s7 --> s9: the server restarts
  s0 --> s1: you /stop the turn
  s9 --> s11: boot recovery runs
  s8 --> s10: the paste or Enter is uncertain
  s11 --> s11: the drive wakes and finds nothing it may take or 30 s pass or you type a draft or a modal opens or the modal closes
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 mayBreak
  class s1 bugPath
